# Underrealm Lich: its controller puts a card into their hand instead of drawing it, and a card moved into a hand without the
# word "draw" is not drawn (CR 121.5, 614.6), so Consecrated Sphinx's "whenever an opponent draws a card" does not trigger.
# Bot2 has the Sphinx out by turn 3. Bot1's turn 3 draw for the turn, before the Lich is cast, is a draw and triggers it (Bot2
# declines). Then Bot1 casts the Lich and Ancestral Recall: three looks at the top three cards, three cards into Bot1's
# hand, and nothing on the stack for the Sphinx.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Underrealm Lich
Ancestral Recall
Plains
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Consecrated Sphinx
Swamp x2
Swamp x20

